WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:33.920
[Episode 18]

01:45.599 --> 01:48.000
Your Majesty, he has confessed.

01:48.000 --> 01:49.760
It was indeed instigated by the Huxiao Gang.

01:49.760 --> 01:52.459
Your Majesty, spare me.

02:11.360 --> 02:13.460
Your Majesty, there is an urgent report.

02:15.900 --> 02:17.599
Your Majesty, an urgent report
from the Imperial Observatory.

02:17.599 --> 02:18.800
There is a celestial anomaly.

02:18.800 --> 02:20.199
Lord Xu, along with the court officials,

02:20.199 --> 02:22.680
has been waiting for you
at the observatory for quite some time.

02:22.680 --> 02:24.180
An anomaly?

02:30.159 --> 02:34.680
His Majesty has visited the Censorate
repeatedly lately to comfort Meng Ting Hui.

02:34.680 --> 02:36.840
Today, for her sake,
he even dispatched the Divine Guard,

02:36.840 --> 02:38.560
parading that criminal through the streets.

02:38.560 --> 02:41.360
Such a grand gesture,
isn't he being way too doting?

02:41.360 --> 02:43.240
Rumors have long circulated

02:43.240 --> 02:45.919
that His Majesty and she
met when they were young

02:45.919 --> 02:47.599
and now they are sovereign and subject.

02:47.599 --> 02:49.599
I'm afraid it will eventually
threaten the moral propriety.

02:49.599 --> 02:52.280
The palace rules and ancestral precepts
are all in place.

02:52.280 --> 02:55.879
How can the imperial court of Ning
become a place of inappropriate romance?

02:55.879 --> 02:59.020
His Majesty has arrived.

03:04.800 --> 03:06.520
Greetings, Your Majesty.

03:06.520 --> 03:08.020
Rise.

03:12.120 --> 03:13.199
Your Majesty,

03:13.199 --> 03:15.039
I observed the celestial phenomena
at night recently,

03:15.039 --> 03:18.360
and found that the continuous heavy rains
are linked to the celestial anomaly.

03:18.360 --> 03:20.039
Since the beginning of the heavy rain,

03:20.039 --> 03:22.879
I've ordered all ministries
to monitor the situation in each prefecture,

03:22.879 --> 03:24.719
and to prepare response strategies.

03:24.719 --> 03:26.240
Your Majesty, that is not the case.

03:26.240 --> 03:28.520
The celestial signs indicate
that the disaster lies within the palace.

03:28.520 --> 03:31.680
The Ziwei Star is dim,
and the Kun position is unsettled,

03:31.680 --> 03:34.080
showing that the palace lacks an empress,
and the yin and yang are disharmonious.

03:34.080 --> 03:36.080
Beside the Hongluan Star,
an ominous star offends the sovereign.

03:36.080 --> 03:37.759
This is a sign of great calamity.

03:37.759 --> 03:39.240
The Hongluan Star governs marriage.

03:39.240 --> 03:41.560
It indicates
that the imperial wedding is imminent.

03:41.560 --> 03:43.080
The ominous star
portends dark and evil forces.

03:43.080 --> 03:45.639
I fear a woman will soon wreak havoc
in the inner palace.

03:45.639 --> 03:48.159
Your Majesty, you should establish an empress
and marry quickly

03:48.159 --> 03:49.439
to comply with the celestial signs,

03:49.439 --> 03:51.840
eliminate the flood,
and stabilize the empire.

03:51.840 --> 03:53.919
Interesting.

03:53.919 --> 03:55.159
I never knew

03:55.159 --> 03:57.680
that the safety of the empire
and the strategy for flood control

03:57.680 --> 03:59.879
were all written in these celestial signs.

03:59.879 --> 04:01.960
Even my own marriage

04:01.960 --> 04:04.319
is also decided by the stars in the sky.

04:04.319 --> 04:06.599
Your Majesty, in just a few short days,

04:06.599 --> 04:10.039
all seven prefectures of Ning
have become waterlogged wastelands.

04:10.039 --> 04:11.840
Since the heavy rain began,

04:11.840 --> 04:16.060
a portrait of a fox spirit
has been circulating among the people.

04:17.519 --> 04:19.040
The common people are all saying

04:19.040 --> 04:22.079
that Your Majesty's closeness
to an evil person

04:22.079 --> 04:23.639
has provoked the wrath of heaven
and the resentment of the people.

04:23.639 --> 04:25.800
Lord Xu, amidst the current floods,

04:25.800 --> 04:29.319
instead of focusing on reinforcing the dikes
and managing disaster relief,

04:29.319 --> 04:32.439
you use street rumors
to impeach officials before me.

04:32.439 --> 04:35.199
Aren't you afraid of being ridiculed
by the world?

04:35.199 --> 04:36.639
Your Majesty, please see clearly.

04:36.639 --> 04:38.600
Besides this fox spirit portrait,

04:38.600 --> 04:42.819
there is another thing
that can corroborate the celestial sign.

04:46.760 --> 04:47.920
[Spirit]

04:47.920 --> 04:50.360
The flood across the seven prefectures
has formed a heavenly script.

04:50.360 --> 04:52.800
How could this be achieved by human effort?

04:52.800 --> 04:57.199
Now, both the celestial signs and the flood
point to Meng Ting Hui being an ominous star.

04:57.199 --> 04:58.319
Your Majesty,

04:58.319 --> 05:02.740
what I say is both the way of heaven
and the will of the people.

05:03.920 --> 05:05.800
Miss Meng requests an audience.

05:05.800 --> 05:07.720
Right now, the thunder has not ceased.

05:07.720 --> 05:10.399
Yet you are here slandering a colleague.

05:10.399 --> 05:12.500
Aren't you afraid of divine retribution?

05:17.120 --> 05:18.839
The celestial instrument
has sensed something.

05:18.839 --> 05:21.279
It seems the celestial signs are indeed true.

05:21.279 --> 05:23.160
Meng Ting Hui?

05:23.160 --> 05:24.660
Why is she here?

05:31.220 --> 05:33.519
Meng Ting Hui,

05:33.519 --> 05:36.480
you entered the palace without a decree.
How do you answer that?

05:36.480 --> 05:40.319
I heard that Lord Xu summoned the officials
but deliberately avoided me,

05:40.319 --> 05:42.720
so naturally,
I had to come and see for myself.

05:42.720 --> 05:43.879
Your Majesty.

05:43.879 --> 05:46.839
The suffering of the people
is all because of me.

05:46.839 --> 05:49.339
I beg for death.

05:51.879 --> 05:54.040
But I have one request.

05:54.040 --> 05:55.600
If after my death,

05:55.600 --> 05:57.920
the rain does not lessen
and the flood does not recede,

05:57.920 --> 06:00.720
please let Lord Xu and Director Lu

06:00.720 --> 06:02.519
offer their lives as a sacrifice to the world

06:02.519 --> 06:04.360
to atone for their crime
of misleading the nation.

06:04.360 --> 06:06.759
Lord Xu, Director Lu,

06:06.759 --> 06:10.160
you keep saying
it's for the sake of the empire.

06:10.160 --> 06:13.000
Then do you dare
to sign this life-and-death pact with me?

06:13.000 --> 06:14.639
What immense audacity!

06:14.639 --> 06:16.720
How dare you threaten me!

06:16.720 --> 06:19.959
Since you believe in these celestial signs
and the way of heaven,

06:19.959 --> 06:21.680
what is there to fear?

06:21.680 --> 06:23.480
Your Majesty, Lord Xu,

06:23.480 --> 06:27.040
this evil woman will stop at nothing
to take down the Huxiao Gang.

06:27.040 --> 06:30.079
I heard that she even resorted to seduction
to escape from the thugs this time.

06:30.079 --> 06:31.600
Her life is worthless.

06:31.600 --> 06:34.639
We must not fall for her cunning scheme.

06:34.639 --> 06:36.600
The dignified female Triple First Zhuangyuan

06:36.600 --> 06:39.120
actually committed
such a disgraceful and immoral act.

06:39.120 --> 06:42.240
Being colleagues with her
is simply our greatest shame.

06:42.240 --> 06:45.720
Your Majesty, please punish this evil woman,

06:45.720 --> 06:47.839
so that the heavy rain may cease,

06:47.839 --> 06:50.540
and appease the wrath of heaven
and the resentment of the people.

06:52.600 --> 06:55.279
I was seeking justice and hunting criminals,
only to face retaliation.

06:55.279 --> 06:58.180
I attracted lightning to save my own life
in a desperate moment.

06:58.180 --> 07:00.779
Yet I am branded as an evil woman by you all.

07:01.600 --> 07:03.899
Since you are determined
to brand me an evil woman,

07:06.000 --> 07:08.480
then I shall show you

07:08.480 --> 07:11.860
exactly what it means
to wreak havoc and defy the heavens.

07:13.600 --> 07:15.100
Miss Meng.

07:45.279 --> 07:48.160
This is pure sin!

07:48.160 --> 07:51.420
An ominous star causing chaos,
the reincarnation of a fox spirit!

07:53.759 --> 07:55.360
Lord Xu,

07:55.360 --> 07:58.560
the ominous star is not in the sky
but in people's hearts.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.120
I come from a humble background,

08:00.120 --> 08:03.279
yet I know
that power should be used for the people.

08:03.279 --> 08:05.839
Lord Xu, you hold the rosewood cane
bestowed by the late emperor,

08:05.839 --> 08:07.720
yet you only know
how to form cliques and attack dissenters.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.920
I ask you,

08:09.920 --> 08:11.720
at this very moment,

08:11.720 --> 08:14.720
have you ever thought of the flood victims
in the seven prefectures of Ning?

08:14.720 --> 08:17.959
The suffering of the people
is all because of you!

08:17.959 --> 08:20.240
Your Majesty,
are you just going to let Meng Ting Hui

08:20.240 --> 08:21.680
act recklessly and bewitch your heart?

08:21.680 --> 08:22.920
Don't use His Majesty to pressure me!

08:22.920 --> 08:24.040
Meng Ting Hui,

08:24.040 --> 08:28.040
the Imperial Observatory
is not a place for you to resort to violence.

08:28.040 --> 08:30.139
Your Majesty, do you also think I am wrong?

08:33.480 --> 08:35.299
Right or wrong,

08:36.600 --> 08:39.220
the people of the world and I
will wait and see!

08:46.980 --> 08:49.399
Your Majesty,
Meng Ting Hui has acted recklessly,

08:49.399 --> 08:50.600
causing a disturbance
at the Imperial Observatory.

08:50.600 --> 08:53.080
If you continue to indulge her,

08:53.080 --> 08:55.480
you will surely face criticism
from the world.

08:55.480 --> 08:56.480
In my opinion,

08:56.480 --> 08:59.039
the top priority now
is to establish an empress without delay,

08:59.039 --> 09:01.059
so as to stabilize the hearts of the people.

09:02.480 --> 09:06.159
Your Majesty, please establish Wen Ruo Mei
as the empress.

09:06.159 --> 09:10.740
Your Majesty,
please prioritize the realm and the state.

09:13.919 --> 09:16.879
You keep talking about the will of heaven.

09:16.879 --> 09:19.139
Is this really the will of heaven,

09:20.380 --> 09:22.539
or the will of men?

09:23.480 --> 09:26.299
The Right Chancellor requests an audience.

09:32.440 --> 09:34.200
Greetings, Your Majesty.

09:34.200 --> 09:38.080
Following your decree, I have urged
all ministries to deal with the floods.

09:38.080 --> 09:40.320
The first batch of water carts
has been delivered to the prefectures.

09:40.320 --> 09:42.519
Although I hold
the position of Right Chancellor,

09:42.519 --> 09:45.360
I came from the Ministry of Works
and am familiar with flood control.

09:45.360 --> 09:48.279
I am willing to inspect the prefectures
on your behalf to reassure the people.

09:48.279 --> 09:50.640
Effective immediately,

09:50.640 --> 09:53.840
all prefectures
must fully support the Right Chancellor

09:53.840 --> 09:55.840
in disaster relief and governance.

09:55.840 --> 09:58.920
On behalf of the disaster victims,
I thank Your Majesty for your grace.

09:58.920 --> 10:01.240
Your Majesty, regarding the matter
of establishing Wen Ruo Mei as empress,

10:01.240 --> 10:04.279
please make a decision today.

10:04.279 --> 10:06.600
When the disaster subsides
and the people rest in peace,

10:06.600 --> 10:08.480
I will naturally issue the decree.

10:08.480 --> 10:11.759
But before that, if anyone

10:11.759 --> 10:14.960
dares to attack court officials

10:14.960 --> 10:17.120
and disrupt disaster relief
with celestial rumors,

10:17.120 --> 10:20.659
they will be executed on the spot
for harming the empire.

10:38.679 --> 10:40.960
<i>The heavy rain has lasted over a month.</i>

10:40.960 --> 10:42.600
<i>Rivers have overflowed.</i>

10:42.600 --> 10:44.480
<i>Fields and homes are submerged.</i>

10:44.480 --> 10:48.320
I, Meng Ting Hui, present
the Ten Strategies for Pacifying the People.

10:48.320 --> 10:50.600
May Your Majesty see clearly.

10:50.600 --> 10:52.399
First, prevent plague.

10:52.399 --> 10:54.840
Set up 100 medicine tents.

10:54.840 --> 10:56.279
Second, manage the refugees.

10:56.279 --> 10:57.960
Provide work as relief.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.960
<i>Third, stabilize farming.</i>

10:59.960 --> 11:01.740
<i>Select high ground to set up granaries.</i>

11:04.480 --> 11:05.980
Meng,

11:08.799 --> 11:12.360
you suffered such a great grievance.
Why didn't you tell me?

11:12.360 --> 11:15.019
If Zhao Cai and Jin Bao
hadn't sent me a message...

11:16.080 --> 11:19.320
You have no idea
how upset I was the whole way here!

11:19.320 --> 11:22.559
I wish I could
hack those two beasts to pieces!

11:22.559 --> 11:24.720
It's all right now.

11:24.720 --> 11:26.659
I'm fine now, aren't I?

11:29.039 --> 11:31.200
How can you be fine?

11:31.200 --> 11:33.159
From Shazhou to the capital,

11:33.159 --> 11:35.539
people were talking about you
all along the way.

11:38.120 --> 11:42.259
I can't imagine how you endured it alone.

11:43.679 --> 11:45.600
I shouldn't have gone back to Shazhou.

11:45.600 --> 11:48.340
I should have stayed with you.

11:51.320 --> 11:53.440
Fu Zhi.

11:53.440 --> 11:55.519
All right.

11:55.519 --> 11:58.080
Stop crying.

11:58.080 --> 12:01.059
What about those two beasts? Are they dead?

12:06.080 --> 12:07.879
They were executed by His Majesty.

12:07.879 --> 12:11.700
I wish I could dig them up
and cut them to pieces.

12:13.679 --> 12:15.080
Just let my father see.

12:15.080 --> 12:18.259
What's the big deal
about digging up a corpse?

12:19.759 --> 12:21.259
Alright.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.960
You went back to Shazhou.

12:23.960 --> 12:25.460
How is your father?

12:26.600 --> 12:28.879
He just tricked me into going back,

12:28.879 --> 12:30.379
and forced me to marry.

12:33.080 --> 12:34.879
I've realized

12:34.879 --> 12:37.919
that you are the only one
who has ever been good to me.

12:37.919 --> 12:41.299
But this time, I failed to protect you.

12:43.159 --> 12:44.399
This stupid spring flood.

12:44.399 --> 12:47.320
It happens every year,
though this year it was more severe.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.519
Why should you take the blame?

12:49.519 --> 12:51.879
What celestial warnings?

12:51.879 --> 12:54.559
What nursery rhymes and prophecies?

12:54.559 --> 12:55.840
Killing by seduction?

12:55.840 --> 12:59.539
That was clearly
that old fool Xu Ting's doing.

13:04.120 --> 13:06.980
I didn't expect even you to know about it.

13:06.980 --> 13:09.720
Since this matter has spread so quickly,

13:09.720 --> 13:12.720
I suppose it has spread
throughout the entire Ning Empire.

13:12.720 --> 13:14.559
Don't take it to heart.

13:14.559 --> 13:17.539
I don't believe
a single word of those absurd rumors.

13:18.440 --> 13:21.340
His Majesty surely won't believe them either.

13:26.759 --> 13:30.360
Meng, tell me the truth.

13:30.360 --> 13:31.899
Do you have feelings

13:33.639 --> 13:35.139
for His Majesty?

13:44.240 --> 13:45.740
How could I?

13:49.039 --> 13:52.259
Before, seeing you two so close, I thought...

13:53.519 --> 13:55.600
It's good that you don't.

13:55.600 --> 13:58.759
The imperial palace is governed
by strict ancestral precepts and etiquette.

13:58.759 --> 14:00.840
A single misstep can cost you your life.

14:00.840 --> 14:04.840
Moreover, His Majesty is taking concubines
before appointing an empress.

14:04.840 --> 14:08.080
In the future, the inner palace
will be full of scheming and intrigue.

14:08.080 --> 14:10.139
Such a life is not suitable for you.

14:20.879 --> 14:22.399
In my eyes,

14:22.399 --> 14:25.259
you deserve the very best in the world.

14:29.880 --> 14:31.320
[Blood Moon Society]

14:31.320 --> 14:32.480
Master,

14:32.480 --> 14:34.879
this joint venture with Ling Yun Fei
to sell Eternity Pills

14:34.879 --> 14:37.080
has yielded a first installment
of 30,000 taels.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.519
As for the private mine in Wanshan,
[Account Book]

14:38.519 --> 14:40.639
it was sealed off
due to Shen Zhi Shu's investigation.

14:40.639 --> 14:43.759
To avoid affecting the overall plan,
I have found another way,

14:43.759 --> 14:46.279
and ordered 300 weapons
on the black market in Beijian.

14:46.279 --> 14:47.720
The transaction can be completed
in seven days.

14:47.720 --> 14:50.480
It will not affect
any of the Blood Moon Society's operations.

14:50.480 --> 14:53.399
Master, on this return
to the old territory of Zhongwan in Qingzhou,

14:53.399 --> 14:56.039
we found
that floods have been frequent recently.

14:56.039 --> 14:57.879
To protect the fertile fields upstream,
the Ning officials

14:57.879 --> 14:59.519
bombed the dikes to release the floodwater.

14:59.519 --> 15:02.559
The Wannu Camp, where Zhongwan refugees live,
was half submerged.

15:02.559 --> 15:05.440
Bodies were floating on the water.

15:05.440 --> 15:09.020
The youngest was only three years old.

15:09.020 --> 15:11.559
Many of our clansmen could only
chew tree bark to stave off hunger.

15:11.559 --> 15:13.879
Some even fought with wild dogs for food.

15:13.879 --> 15:16.899
To save a mouthful of food
for their grandchildren,

15:17.759 --> 15:19.259
many elders starved to death.

15:23.679 --> 15:27.519
Master, the people of Zhongwan
are suffering now.

15:27.519 --> 15:31.200
Should the money be used
to buy weapons as originally planned,

15:31.200 --> 15:34.840
or to buy food and medicine to settle them?

15:34.840 --> 15:37.919
The arms trade is a razor's-edge business.

15:37.919 --> 15:39.279
If we renege now,

15:39.279 --> 15:42.080
who would dare do business with us
in the future?

15:42.080 --> 15:44.440
But weapons can wait, human lives cannot.

15:44.440 --> 15:46.559
We have endured for ten years.

15:46.559 --> 15:50.600
We cannot let it all be ruined
by a few starving old and weak people.

15:50.600 --> 15:52.279
On the day we restore the empire,

15:52.279 --> 15:57.519
I will surely make those Ning officials
pay with their blood.

15:57.519 --> 15:59.440
Master,

15:59.440 --> 16:03.399
the survival of the people
is what makes our vengeance a debt of blood.

16:03.399 --> 16:06.279
If even this bloodline is severed,

16:06.279 --> 16:07.779
what use are weapons alone?

16:11.000 --> 16:13.659
The great cause of restoration
cannot afford softness.

16:15.399 --> 16:19.559
The starving women and children
will just incite public anger,

16:19.559 --> 16:22.899
helping the Blood Moon Society
recruit loyal followers.

16:25.440 --> 16:26.879
Although I sealed off the private mine,

16:26.879 --> 16:29.680
they seemed to realize I was tailing them
and suddenly turned back.

16:29.680 --> 16:31.879
After buying spices and timber
at the border market,

16:31.879 --> 16:33.519
there was no further unusual activity.

16:33.519 --> 16:35.039
Their sudden change of route

16:35.039 --> 16:37.679
might be because
Situ Xue secretly passed on a message.

16:37.679 --> 16:40.000
I thought the same, so I played along,

16:40.000 --> 16:41.639
pretending not to notice their abnormality,

16:41.639 --> 16:43.240
and even deliberately changed my route
to go to Shazhou.

16:43.240 --> 16:46.039
In fact, I had dispatched men secretly
to observe them covertly.

16:46.039 --> 16:47.580
And they actually discovered this.

16:50.759 --> 16:52.639
Blood Moon Society?

16:52.639 --> 16:55.279
It seems Situ Xue and Huiyin House
were just a cover.

16:55.279 --> 16:58.299
They are secretly
working for the Blood Moon Society.

16:59.120 --> 17:00.960
The Blood Moon Society

17:00.960 --> 17:04.319
might be the one
behind the arms trade in Shazhou.

17:04.319 --> 17:05.920
Since that's the case,

17:05.920 --> 17:08.599
they bought
a massive amount of arms in Shazhou,

17:08.599 --> 17:10.599
and when thwarted, turned to illegal mining.

17:10.599 --> 17:11.759
Just what are they scheming to do?

17:11.759 --> 17:13.960
Do you remember I once mentioned to you

17:13.960 --> 17:16.279
that after the fall
of the Zhongwan royal family,

17:16.279 --> 17:18.640
a mysterious force disappeared
without a trace?

17:18.640 --> 17:21.240
The Blood Moon Society
might be connected to them.

17:21.240 --> 17:23.059
Could they be trying to restore their empire?

17:24.519 --> 17:26.920
No wonder
the Xiyan flower symbolizes revenge.

17:26.920 --> 17:29.720
So they have been
secretly plotting restoration all along.

17:29.720 --> 17:32.839
Your Majesty, should we
seal off Huiyin House immediately?

17:32.839 --> 17:34.440
No.

17:34.440 --> 17:36.359
The Blood Moon Society
has not yet revealed its full extent.

17:36.359 --> 17:38.559
Closing the net now
would only cut off some claws.

17:38.559 --> 17:40.200
Keep monitoring Huiyin House.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.920
Follow the lead of Situ Xue,

17:41.920 --> 17:44.599
and you will surely root out
the mastermind behind the Blood Moon Society.

17:44.599 --> 17:46.099
Yes.

17:48.119 --> 17:50.559
Your Majesty, I have reported everything.

17:50.559 --> 17:52.599
You should also grant me some clarity.

17:52.599 --> 17:54.359
On the way back with me,

17:54.359 --> 17:55.920
Miss Yan cried her eyes out.

17:55.920 --> 17:57.519
Miss Meng has already suffered injustice.

17:57.519 --> 17:59.279
Yet the Imperial Observatory
still spouts nonsense about celestial signs.

17:59.279 --> 18:01.079
Even Lord Xu
took the opportunity to attack her.

18:01.079 --> 18:04.099
Even I feel that Miss Meng is truly pitiful.

18:05.640 --> 18:09.200
Then perhaps, you could
reassign Miss Meng to another position.

18:09.200 --> 18:11.799
If she were willing to give up,
she wouldn't be Meng Ting Hui.

18:11.799 --> 18:13.480
Her pursuit of the Huxiao Gang

18:13.480 --> 18:15.319
is no longer driven by personal vendetta,

18:15.319 --> 18:17.519
but for the people of the Ning Empire.

18:17.519 --> 18:20.519
I hope that now,
in addition to the old Zhongwan case,

18:20.519 --> 18:22.200
you will also take up a post in the Censorate

18:22.200 --> 18:23.700
and protect her.

18:25.200 --> 18:27.119
Your Majesty, you treat Miss Meng

18:27.119 --> 18:29.960
far more carefully than I had imagined.

18:29.960 --> 18:33.740
Are you still taking Minister Wen's daughter
as a consort?

19:01.440 --> 19:04.099
Miss, this is the Rain Bell I made.

19:07.200 --> 19:10.480
Even on a rainy day, you can see a rainbow.

19:10.480 --> 19:12.039
It is a good omen.

19:12.039 --> 19:15.200
Soon, the rain will stop
and the sky will clear.

19:15.200 --> 19:18.200
People say that exquisite workmanship
is just empty words,

19:18.200 --> 19:20.980
but today, you have proven it true.

19:23.200 --> 19:25.640
I haven't seen you smile in a long time.

19:25.640 --> 19:27.220
You look beautiful when you smile.

19:28.079 --> 19:30.240
At this moment, even the rainbow in the sky

19:30.240 --> 19:33.460
pales in comparison to you.

19:34.480 --> 19:36.180
Don't flatter me anymore.

19:37.079 --> 19:38.880
Miss,

19:38.880 --> 19:41.160
no matter how great the storms in this world,

19:41.160 --> 19:43.099
they will eventually cease one day.

19:45.240 --> 19:47.960
I cannot cease the storms,

19:47.960 --> 19:50.259
but I can harness the momentum of the storm.

20:06.480 --> 20:08.400
This is a small gadget I always keep.

20:08.400 --> 20:09.940
I give it to you for self-defense.

20:19.119 --> 20:21.099
If I encounter real danger,

20:22.079 --> 20:24.160
how can this small gadget be enough?

20:24.160 --> 20:27.519
After following you for so long,
I have also improved.

20:27.519 --> 20:30.119
I have long devised a foolproof plan for you.

20:30.119 --> 20:31.480
This is a sleeve arrow.

20:31.480 --> 20:33.000
It won't hurt your hand when worn daily,

20:33.000 --> 20:34.660
and it's not easily noticed.

20:38.799 --> 20:40.299
Colorful marbles.

20:46.079 --> 20:47.579
Throwing darts.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.940
Wait, there's more...

20:52.960 --> 20:54.460
Yin Qing,

20:55.680 --> 20:57.180
thank you.

21:00.839 --> 21:02.680
Miss,

21:02.680 --> 21:05.900
as long as I am here,
I will definitely keep you safe.

21:35.640 --> 21:38.059
Who dares to break into the Censorate?

22:22.839 --> 22:24.339
Greetings, Your Majesty.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.900
Rise.

22:30.720 --> 22:33.460
Your Majesty, this is...

22:37.160 --> 22:39.680
Greetings, Miss Meng!

22:39.680 --> 22:42.799
When the Censorate was first established,
no dedicated personnel were assigned.

22:42.799 --> 22:44.119
It was my oversight.

22:44.119 --> 22:46.599
These are 12 light cavalrymen
I personally selected.

22:46.599 --> 22:48.119
They are all highly skilled in martial arts.

22:48.119 --> 22:50.680
From now on,
they will serve in the Censorate,

22:50.680 --> 22:52.180
and are at your disposal.

22:55.240 --> 22:59.019
Miss Meng, name your new subordinates.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.740
Thank you, Your Majesty.

23:12.960 --> 23:14.279
From today onward,

23:14.279 --> 23:16.920
you shall be the Light Cavalry of Censorate.

23:16.920 --> 23:19.640
Silent as shadows, swift as the wind.

23:19.640 --> 23:21.720
Blades unseen,

23:21.720 --> 23:23.460
a single strike to kill.

23:24.960 --> 23:26.880
Thank you, Miss Meng, for granting us a name.

23:26.880 --> 23:29.519
We will swear loyalty to the Censorate

23:29.519 --> 23:31.420
and to Miss Meng unto death!

23:41.120 --> 23:43.680
[Censorate]

23:56.440 --> 23:58.480
I have summoned an imperial physician
for you.

23:58.480 --> 23:59.980
He will be here soon.

24:06.079 --> 24:08.000
This rain has truly not stopped.

24:08.000 --> 24:09.839
Your Majesty, aren't you afraid of me,
the evil woman?

24:09.839 --> 24:13.039
When have I ever said
I believed such nonsense?

24:13.039 --> 24:14.359
Your Ten Strategies for Pacifying the People

24:14.359 --> 24:16.079
has been fully implemented by Lord Gu.

24:16.079 --> 24:17.740
Flood control has shown results.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.680
That day, you dared to wield a sword.

24:22.680 --> 24:25.180
Aren't you afraid
Lord Xu would charge you with treason?

24:34.279 --> 24:36.960
The Huxiao Gang and its protector
have not yet been rooted out.

24:36.960 --> 24:39.800
I will not allow you

24:39.800 --> 24:42.460
to jeopardize the chance to avenge yourself
over a mere bronze plate.

24:46.960 --> 24:48.920
I am not afraid of impeachment.

24:48.920 --> 24:51.240
Someone has to do the hard things.

24:51.240 --> 24:54.480
Whether it's celestial signs or insults,

24:54.480 --> 24:56.099
they all aim to destroy my reputation.

24:57.240 --> 24:58.759
But I do not care.

24:58.759 --> 25:00.839
While they stand at the observatory
pointing fingers at the realm,

25:00.839 --> 25:03.559
I shall tear the celestial scripture
to shreds

25:03.559 --> 25:05.240
and let them see

25:05.240 --> 25:08.740
that the so-called divine punishment
is nothing but a man-made lie.

25:15.839 --> 25:18.599
They used the celestial signs as a pretext
to attack you,

25:18.599 --> 25:22.519
merely to express
their dissatisfaction with my new policies.

25:22.519 --> 25:23.880
Sorry for putting you through this.

25:23.880 --> 25:26.720
But I have never
believed in any celestial signs.

25:26.720 --> 25:28.220
I believe in you.

25:31.000 --> 25:33.039
I don't feel wronged.

25:33.039 --> 25:36.039
You use me as a sword
to eliminate the court's long-standing ills.

25:36.039 --> 25:37.839
It is my honor.

25:37.839 --> 25:39.980
Whether it is the gang or the protector,

25:42.880 --> 25:45.039
I will definitely get to the bottom of it.

25:45.039 --> 25:48.319
In the future,
I'll only act more ruthlessly and decisively.

25:48.319 --> 25:51.160
What Your Majesty cannot do, I will do.

25:51.160 --> 25:53.640
I know you will not give in easily.

25:53.640 --> 25:54.880
Besides the Light Cavalry,

25:54.880 --> 25:57.519
I will transfer Di Nian and Shen Zhi Shu
into the Censorate

25:57.519 --> 25:59.200
to assist you
in thoroughly investigating the Huxiao Gang.

25:59.200 --> 26:03.220
I will also fully support your actions.

26:06.079 --> 26:07.980
Thank you, Your Majesty.

26:18.279 --> 26:20.799
After the composite sketch was posted,

26:20.799 --> 26:23.599
the Censorate received many important leads.

26:23.599 --> 26:27.559
I will surely follow these clues
to find their hiding place,

26:27.559 --> 26:28.960
and capture them all in one fell swoop.

26:28.960 --> 26:30.579
We will do it together.

26:33.640 --> 26:37.000
Your Majesty,
you brought the Light Cavalry here today.

26:37.000 --> 26:38.759
It will surely
invite criticism again tomorrow.

26:38.759 --> 26:40.119
The court officials have already said

26:40.119 --> 26:41.680
that I am excessively favored.

26:41.680 --> 26:44.279
You should return early.

26:44.279 --> 26:47.680
Otherwise, another storm of blood and gore
will surely be brought tomorrow.

26:47.680 --> 26:50.940
Sometimes, I do wonder,

26:56.000 --> 27:01.299
what exactly is the relationship between us?

27:05.559 --> 27:07.059
Mutual exploitation.

27:09.079 --> 27:10.579
Mutual need.

27:12.359 --> 27:14.260
As monarch and minister.

27:14.260 --> 27:16.420
Not even friends?

27:21.880 --> 27:23.759
Of course, we are friends.

27:23.759 --> 27:25.299
Long have we awaited.

27:26.480 --> 27:27.980
There is none like this in the world.

27:35.400 --> 27:37.460
There is none like this in the world.

27:51.319 --> 27:53.039
Your Majesty,

27:53.039 --> 27:54.539
the sky has cleared.

28:18.600 --> 28:20.140
Good.

28:21.140 --> 28:23.079
Very well.

28:23.079 --> 28:24.720
The floodwaters have receded
in all prefectures.

28:24.720 --> 28:26.400
The disaster victims
have been properly settled.

28:26.400 --> 28:28.299
The farmland has not suffered major damage.

28:31.559 --> 28:32.960
Your Majesty, you're wise indeed.

28:32.960 --> 28:35.480
Even the heavens
are moved by your benevolence

28:35.480 --> 28:37.640
and have specially cleared the sky
for the Ning Empire.

28:37.640 --> 28:40.880
Look at this rainbow.
It is a sign of auspiciousness.

28:40.880 --> 28:43.200
It brings to mind
a passage from the ancient texts.

28:43.200 --> 28:45.559
The ways of nature are constant.
They exist not for a sage-emperor,

28:45.559 --> 28:46.599
nor do they perish for a tyrant.

28:46.599 --> 28:49.640
However, this time,
if I had not overruled all objections

28:49.640 --> 28:51.359
and adopted Meng Ting Hui's plan,

28:51.359 --> 28:53.519
even with Lord Gu's experienced statecraft,

28:53.519 --> 28:56.400
it would have been difficult
to withstand the once-in-a-century flood.

28:56.400 --> 28:58.440
Miss Meng indeed
made indispensable contributions.

28:58.440 --> 28:59.620
Even the veteran officials
of the Ministry of Works

28:59.620 --> 29:02.339
are praising
her Ten Strategies for Pacifying the People.

29:03.359 --> 29:06.559
When Lord Gu returns to court,
I will hold a victory banquet.

29:06.559 --> 29:08.680
Not a single one deserving reward
shall be missed.

29:08.680 --> 29:10.540
Your...

29:10.540 --> 29:12.759
- Forget it.
- Just say what you have to say.

29:12.759 --> 29:14.559
Your Majesty,

29:14.559 --> 29:18.400
there have been unsavory rumors
in and out of court these days.

29:18.400 --> 29:19.759
- About Meng Ting Hui?
- No.

29:19.759 --> 29:21.319
About you.

29:21.319 --> 29:23.300
They say that day,

29:23.300 --> 29:27.079
when Wen Ruo Mei served you
at the hot spring,

29:27.079 --> 29:28.920
she expressed her affection to you,

29:28.920 --> 29:32.319
and you favored her on a whim
that very night,

29:32.319 --> 29:35.960
and promised to confer her as a consort
once the flood subsided.

29:35.960 --> 29:37.920
Your Majesty,

29:37.920 --> 29:40.759
such rumors have come up strangely.

29:40.759 --> 29:41.880
I fear they are not groundless.

29:41.880 --> 29:44.519
Should we strengthen palace patrols
to guard against unforeseen events?

29:44.519 --> 29:45.759
Even if they are groundless,

29:45.759 --> 29:48.000
they still damage
His Majesty's imperial dignity.

29:48.000 --> 29:49.740
You have the nerve to say that?

29:52.640 --> 29:55.440
Lord Xu is truly impatient.

29:55.440 --> 29:58.079
He thinks he can force me to submit
with some rumors.

29:58.079 --> 30:02.220
Since the flood has receded,
I will issue the decree today.

30:02.220 --> 30:04.400
Your Majesty, you agreed?

30:04.400 --> 30:06.119
Of course.

30:06.119 --> 30:08.799
Today, I will give him a satisfactory answer.

30:08.799 --> 30:10.399
Your Majesty, you are wise.

30:10.400 --> 30:13.360
[Censorate]

30:19.400 --> 30:21.480
Miss, everyone is here.

30:21.480 --> 30:23.640
We can begin
to compile the clues on Ling Yun Fei.

30:23.640 --> 30:25.839
Didn't His Majesty say he would come today?

30:25.839 --> 30:29.119
Today is the lucky day His Majesty picked
to officially betroth the Wen woman.

30:29.119 --> 30:30.839
How could he get away?

30:30.839 --> 30:33.180
Is His Majesty
really going to marry Wen Ruo Mei?

30:34.400 --> 30:36.720
What does Wen Ruo Mei look like?

30:36.720 --> 30:38.359
Enough.

30:38.359 --> 30:40.559
His Majesty taking a consort
is a state affair.

30:40.559 --> 30:43.799
Our case must also be handled promptly.

30:43.799 --> 30:46.400
The Huxiao Gang was established
only five years ago,

30:46.400 --> 30:48.680
yet it has not only infiltrated local forces,

30:48.680 --> 30:51.720
but also deeply colluded with officials
in the capital.

30:51.720 --> 30:54.240
Ling Yun Fei is so young,

30:54.240 --> 30:56.760
yet he has such methods.

30:56.760 --> 30:59.480
Could it be related to his background?

30:59.480 --> 31:01.039
I have looked into it.

31:01.039 --> 31:03.759
Ling Yun Fei's real mother was a courtesan.

31:03.759 --> 31:05.720
He lived a hard life with his mother
since childhood.

31:05.720 --> 31:07.319
His father is unknown.

31:07.319 --> 31:09.920
It is said he was a scoundrel
who abandoned his wife and child.

31:09.920 --> 31:12.759
We previously suspected Wanxiang Pavilion.

31:12.759 --> 31:15.000
Why didn't you say it earlier?

31:15.000 --> 31:17.720
Since Ling Yun Fei's mother was a courtesan,

31:17.720 --> 31:20.000
could there really be a close connection

31:20.000 --> 31:22.819
between Wanxiang Pavilion and Ling Yun Fei?

31:23.759 --> 31:25.640
Another thing.

31:25.640 --> 31:29.200
Wanxiang Pavilion released a miraculous drug
called the Eternity Pill lately.

31:29.200 --> 31:30.720
It is said to enhance pleasure
and cure ailments,

31:30.720 --> 31:32.960
causing rapid addiction that is hard to quit.

31:32.960 --> 31:34.400
But it is expensive and hard to find.

31:34.400 --> 31:36.519
It has now become a refined hobby
among wealthy merchants.

31:36.519 --> 31:38.079
I have verified it.

31:38.079 --> 31:39.220
The Eternity Pill

31:39.220 --> 31:42.720
was exactly leaked out from Xiang Ning,
the top courtesan of Wanxiang Pavilion.

31:42.720 --> 31:44.279
It is extremely scarce on the market.

31:44.279 --> 31:47.440
There are actually many people
who, in order to obtain an Eternity Pill,

31:47.440 --> 31:50.200
would not hesitate to sell their daughters
to Wanxiang Pavilion.

31:50.200 --> 31:52.839
Miss, locals report

31:52.839 --> 31:56.240
seeing a suspected Ling Yun Fei
frequenting Wanxiang Pavilion lately.

31:56.240 --> 31:59.579
The Eternity Pill is most likely
a Huxiao Gang business.

32:00.480 --> 32:04.000
I suggest we start with the top courtesan,

32:04.000 --> 32:06.440
and follow the clues to find Ling Yun Fei.

32:06.440 --> 32:10.600
It seems we must go to Wanxiang Pavilion.

32:10.600 --> 32:13.200
Miss, I will go with you.

32:13.200 --> 32:15.700
If you have any news in the future,
tell me immediately.

32:19.599 --> 32:23.880
Such an elegant place
is beneath your dignity.

32:23.880 --> 32:28.180
If you inadvertently fall into its charms,
it will only lead you astray.

32:30.880 --> 32:32.480
I am the more suitable person to go.

32:32.480 --> 32:35.759
I've taken enough detours in my life
to be considered experienced.

32:35.759 --> 32:38.640
More people mean more variables.

32:38.640 --> 32:41.619
This time, I will go alone.

32:47.960 --> 32:49.640
[Xu Mansion]

32:50.600 --> 32:52.279
You unfilial son!

32:52.279 --> 32:54.160
The moment you step out of this estate today,

32:54.160 --> 32:56.559
you will no longer be my son!

32:56.559 --> 32:58.319
- When it rained, you didn't let me see her,
- My lord.

32:58.319 --> 32:59.359
calling her an evil woman.

32:59.359 --> 33:01.319
Now that the sky is clear,
which means she is no longer an evil woman.

33:01.319 --> 33:02.440
Why can't I go see her?

33:02.440 --> 33:03.920
I'm going anyway!

33:03.920 --> 33:05.900
Seize him!

33:06.720 --> 33:07.920
My lord.

33:07.920 --> 33:08.920
You can't stop me!

33:08.920 --> 33:10.680
Meng Ting Hui, I'm coming for you!

33:10.680 --> 33:13.480
My lord, please calm down.

33:13.480 --> 33:15.359
Ze is merely young and impulsive.

33:15.359 --> 33:17.039
He acted foolishly in a moment of weakness.

33:17.039 --> 33:19.039
You spoiled him rotten,

33:19.039 --> 33:21.359
and now he is completely out of control!

33:21.359 --> 33:23.079
Yes, yes. It's all my fault.

33:23.079 --> 33:24.579
Please calm down.

33:27.759 --> 33:30.220
Greetings, Your Majesty.

33:32.920 --> 33:35.599
My lady, it's spread everywhere outside.

33:35.599 --> 33:37.799
They say His Majesty has personally promised

33:37.799 --> 33:41.240
that once the disaster subsides,
he will issue the imperial decree

33:41.240 --> 33:44.220
to welcome you into the palace
and confer you as a consort.

33:46.240 --> 33:47.740
Let's practice again.

33:53.880 --> 33:55.160
You clumsy idiot!

33:55.160 --> 33:57.880
If you ruin my face,
how many lives do you have to pay for it?

33:57.880 --> 34:00.559
My lady, please calm your anger.
It was my poor eyesight.

34:00.559 --> 34:01.920
I deserve to be beaten.

34:01.920 --> 34:03.640
With your lack of perception,

34:03.640 --> 34:06.160
how can you serve me in the palace
in the future?

34:06.160 --> 34:08.519
If you are still this clumsy
before His Majesty,

34:08.519 --> 34:10.440
won't you make me a laughingstock?

34:10.440 --> 34:11.920
My lady, you're right.

34:11.920 --> 34:14.079
I will surely learn the rules well.

34:14.079 --> 34:16.719
Enough, I'm tired.

34:16.719 --> 34:18.219
I'll take a rest.

34:20.400 --> 34:24.920
My lady, this is Dong'e gelatin soup,

34:24.920 --> 34:26.760
slow-cooked
with the finest Dong'e donkey-hide gelatin.

34:26.760 --> 34:29.679
They say it not only nourishes your vitality,

34:29.679 --> 34:31.900
but also makes you absolutely radiant.

34:41.000 --> 34:44.360
- Such a good thing, I need this every day.
- Yes.

34:44.360 --> 34:46.280
Mei. Mei!

34:46.280 --> 34:48.440
Quick. Quick.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.710
Receive the imperial decree now.

34:49.710 --> 34:52.039
Father, the imperial edict is here!

34:52.039 --> 34:54.159
Father, is His Majesty
granting me a marriage?

34:54.159 --> 34:56.460
Don't talk nonsense! Maybe His Majesty

34:56.460 --> 34:59.079
is granting some rare treasures
to your father.

34:59.079 --> 35:01.080
Nonsense.

35:01.080 --> 35:02.740
Read the decree.

35:07.360 --> 35:12.559
I observe that Xu Run Ze,
son of Lord Xu Ting, the Left Chancellor...

35:12.559 --> 35:16.079
And Wen Ruo Mei,
daughter of Minister Wen Tao,

35:16.079 --> 35:19.500
are of a similar age and share noble virtues.

35:19.500 --> 35:23.599
Both are the finest of their generation
and make a truly matchless couple.

35:23.599 --> 35:26.599
To bless this match made in heaven...

35:26.599 --> 35:28.599
I hereby decree their union.

35:28.599 --> 35:32.599
Wen Ruo Mei shall be betrothed to Xu Run Ze.

35:32.599 --> 35:35.119
May they be bound for a lifetime.

35:35.119 --> 35:37.880
Let an auspicious day be chosen
for their wedding.

35:37.880 --> 35:40.039
Let an auspicious day be chosen
for their wedding.

35:40.039 --> 35:41.880
Xu Run Ze?

35:41.880 --> 35:44.320
Is he the foolish son of the Xu family

35:44.320 --> 35:45.639
who drooled at 7,

35:45.639 --> 35:48.400
wet the bed at 10,
and still recited "People are pigs"

35:48.400 --> 35:50.760
instead of "People are born kind" at 13?

35:50.760 --> 35:53.219
Lord Xu, receive the decree.

36:03.780 --> 36:05.939
Is the decree written incorrectly?

36:05.939 --> 36:07.559
My daughter is pure-hearted and wise.

36:07.559 --> 36:09.299
She has always admired His Majesty.

36:09.299 --> 36:13.039
She is not a match for Mr. Xu.

36:13.039 --> 36:15.000
Minister Wen,

36:15.000 --> 36:16.719
are you defying the decree?

36:16.719 --> 36:17.920
No, no.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.900
How would I?

36:27.740 --> 36:31.160
I don't want to marry that foolish woman!

36:31.160 --> 36:33.440
Mother, I won't marry her!

36:33.440 --> 36:36.679
If I marry her, I'd rather
go to the temple and become a monk!

36:36.679 --> 36:40.480
My lord, are you
really making Ze marry Wen Ruo Mei?

36:40.480 --> 36:41.920
Father, say something!

36:41.920 --> 36:45.260
- Say something, Father!
- You must stand up for Ze!

36:45.260 --> 36:47.420
Father, go beg His Majesty now!

36:47.420 --> 36:49.559
- Have him retract his order!
- Nonsense.

36:49.559 --> 36:52.119
An imperial decree is no child's play!

36:52.119 --> 36:55.360
It's all your fault! You insisted
I enter the palace to seduce favor.

36:55.360 --> 36:57.420
So His Majesty is toying with me now.

36:58.199 --> 37:00.039
- My Empress dream!
- Mei!

37:00.039 --> 37:02.960
My lady. My lady!

37:02.960 --> 37:04.619
My lady, please slow down!

37:06.800 --> 37:08.560
[Shen Mansion]

37:17.140 --> 37:19.519
Master Zhi Shu, there is a young lady outside
seeking an audience.

37:19.519 --> 37:23.039
I'm not in the mood to see anyone today.
Make an excuse for me.

37:23.039 --> 37:26.280
But she says
she is Ms. Yan from Bofeng House.

37:26.280 --> 37:28.619
Mr. Shen,
you certainly put on great official airs.

37:29.559 --> 37:30.800
I wondered who it was.

37:30.800 --> 37:32.520
So it's Ms. Yan.

37:32.520 --> 37:34.639
What is it?
Have you received a new batch of grape wine,

37:34.639 --> 37:36.760
or has Bofeng House developed new dishes

37:36.760 --> 37:38.360
that warrants your personal visit?

37:38.360 --> 37:40.000
After the Alcohol Monopoly Decree,

37:40.000 --> 37:42.199
government-run alcohol
has monopolized the market.

37:42.199 --> 37:44.800
Bofeng House's Shaosanbai wine
is about to run out.

37:44.800 --> 37:46.800
Mr. Shen, you are in charge of this matter,

37:46.800 --> 37:48.320
so you should be aware.

37:48.320 --> 37:51.320
The new decree from the court
is to rectify market order.

37:51.320 --> 37:53.679
Ms. Yan, your Bofeng House
is a prominent target.

37:53.679 --> 37:55.360
You should set an example.

37:55.360 --> 37:58.080
The official winery
cannot provide the flavor I want.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.840
Mr. Shen, you have tasted
the most authentic Shaosanbai wine,

38:00.840 --> 38:02.840
and personally praised it,

38:02.840 --> 38:04.400
saying it's fierce
as the wind beyond the frontier,

38:04.400 --> 38:06.079
and mellow as the affections of old friends.

38:06.079 --> 38:09.599
How could the rigid rules of official winery
ever compare?

38:09.599 --> 38:13.159
You wouldn't have the heart
to cut off the flavor of my homeland, right?

38:13.159 --> 38:15.099
Ms. Yan, you are so agitated.

38:16.159 --> 38:18.539
Are you seeking a favor from me?

38:19.400 --> 38:21.360
I am reasoning with the Envoy of Customs.

38:21.360 --> 38:23.480
Bofeng House has several dozen employees,

38:23.480 --> 38:27.000
and all the master craftsmen
who followed me from Shazhou to the capital.

38:27.000 --> 38:29.059
I cannot let them lose their livelihoods.

38:32.599 --> 38:33.960
Take a good look.

38:33.960 --> 38:36.719
With joint guarantees from three agencies,
authorized merchants

38:36.719 --> 38:39.059
can maintain
their original purchasing channels.

38:40.679 --> 38:44.420
Your special permit
was delivered three days ago.

38:48.760 --> 38:51.800
So you deliberately
didn't have it sent to me,

38:51.800 --> 38:53.400
and were waiting for me to come?

38:53.400 --> 38:55.280
Yes.

38:55.280 --> 38:56.840
Every time you came to see me,

38:56.840 --> 38:58.360
it was either for business negotiations,

38:58.360 --> 39:00.179
or to plead for others.

39:04.679 --> 39:06.079
Yan Fu Zhi,

39:06.079 --> 39:12.219
when will you come for me only just once?

39:20.840 --> 39:22.420
Mr. Shen,

39:25.719 --> 39:28.280
has anyone ever told you

39:28.280 --> 39:30.519
that you are very good-looking?

39:30.519 --> 39:33.039
Especially the eyes of yours,

39:33.039 --> 39:34.820
they look at everyone
with such deep affection.

39:36.079 --> 39:39.320
It's just that I only like your face,

39:39.320 --> 39:40.940
but I don't trust you.

39:41.760 --> 39:42.800
Don't trust me for what?

39:42.800 --> 39:47.280
I simply cannot believe that Mr. Shen,
surrounded by noble ladies of the capital,

39:47.280 --> 39:50.000
would truly be willing to forsake
such a life of dazzling splendor,

39:50.000 --> 39:52.280
to pledge a lifelong devotion

39:52.280 --> 39:55.880
to a merchant's daughter like me.

39:55.880 --> 39:58.159
Even less do I believe

39:58.159 --> 40:00.649
that I would ever give up
the endless sea of handsome men in my future,

40:00.649 --> 40:04.679
just to be tied to a single tree like you.

40:04.679 --> 40:08.260
This deal is not worth it.

40:10.519 --> 40:13.420
I'll take the permit. Thank you.

40:15.159 --> 40:16.820
How do you know I'm not sincere?

40:18.700 --> 40:22.400
Mr. Shen, your past romantic affairs
are well known to everyone,

40:22.400 --> 40:24.760
and you are quite adept at charming girls.

40:24.760 --> 40:26.920
Shen Zhi Shu,

40:26.920 --> 40:30.380
if you're just playing around,
I am willing to play along,

40:34.639 --> 40:36.179
but if you are sincere,

40:39.719 --> 40:41.860
then show me your sincerity.

40:47.360 --> 40:49.179
What if I cut off all other romantic ties?

40:53.280 --> 40:57.820
Then clean up all your mess

40:59.960 --> 41:01.540
before you come to ask me again.

41:30.159 --> 41:32.360
The guests who usually come here

41:32.360 --> 41:34.320
are either wealthy but ugly,

41:34.320 --> 41:36.679
utterly tasteless,

41:36.679 --> 41:39.079
or handsome but penniless,

41:39.079 --> 41:41.559
with empty pockets.

41:41.559 --> 41:47.219
It's rare to meet a gentleman like you today,
who's both wealthy and handsome.

41:48.320 --> 41:50.159
I don't believe it.

41:50.159 --> 41:54.900
I've heard that your suitors
are all wealthy and powerful.

41:56.159 --> 41:59.559
Even the famous leader of Huxiao Gang

41:59.559 --> 42:01.760
is completely entranced by you,

42:01.760 --> 42:04.159
always coming to show his support.

42:04.159 --> 42:07.719
The court offered a reward of 10,000 taels
for that villain's capture.

42:07.719 --> 42:11.019
If I knew him,
I would have been rich already.
